---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Icon from '../components/Icon.astro';
import { loadStatus } from '../lib/data';
import { formatBytes, formatDate, formatNumber } from '../lib/format';
const status = await loadStatus();
---
<Layout title="同步记录" active="updates">
  <div class="page-heading"><div><h1>同步记录</h1><p>查看定制规则的最近一次成功同步。</p></div><a class="text-link" href="https://github.com/ClaraCora/magicrule-backup/actions/workflows/sync.yml" rel="noopener noreferrer">查看工作流 <Icon name="external" size={16}/></a></div>
  <div class="sync-summary"><div><span class="health-dot"></span><strong>最近一次成功同步</strong><p>{formatDate(status.lastSuccessfulSyncAt, true)}</p></div><dl><div><dt>定制规则</dt><dd>{formatNumber(status.activeRuleCount)}</dd></div><div><dt>订阅文件</dt><dd>{formatNumber(status.artifactCount)}</dd></div><div><dt>文件总量</dt><dd>{formatBytes(status.totalBytes)}</dd></div></dl></div>
  <p class="inline-note">每日 04:17（北京时间）自动检查。文件版本可在 <a href="https://github.com/ClaraCora/magicrule-backup/commits/data/current/custom/">Git 历史</a>中查阅。</p>
</Layout>
